archive-ehr-message = The EHR and all its content move to the cold tier. It stays readable by id, but it leaves every query result until it is restored.
restore-ehr-message = The EHR's archived content moves back to the primary tier and appears in query results again.
archive-party-message = The party moves to the cold tier. It stays readable by id, but it leaves every query result until it is restored. Its relationships stay where they are.
restore-party-message = The party's archived content moves back to the primary tier and appears in query results again.
